{"parentUuid":"550fbc04-dbd6-4565-92da-a82be0df30b3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5","id":"msg_011Cf3g2pYvqrps5DtB8JwX1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Corrigé. La distinction est notée dans le skill sous forme de tableau, avec la raison : le support commande le verbe.\n\n| Support | Ce qu'on fait | Phrase |\n|---|---|---|\n| **Le post** (le texte publié, trois langues) | on LIT | thanks for reading, like for more! ᕙ(\\`▿´)ᕗ |\n| **Le short** (la vidéo, dernier cue à l'écran) | on REGARDE | thanks for watching, follow, like for more! ᕙ(\\`▿´)ᕗ |\n\n**Les 10 cues, la signature ferme le short**\n\n| # | Temps | Ligne 1 | Ligne 2 |\n|---:|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 0 à 3 s | Today I focused on UV texel harmony | across the whole church. |\n| 2 | 3 à 6 s | The problem was simple: from one pattern | to the next, my UVs had no global harmony. |\n| 3 | 6 à 9 s | So I took my height map, | which already gave me a clear pattern, |\n| 4 | 9 à 12 s | and pushed it into the base color | just to get a proper debug view. |\n| 5 | 12 à 15 s | Instead of patching things by hand, | I set one global texel density. |\n| 6 | 15 à 18 s | Everything is computed properly now, | the whole building shares one scale. |\n| 7 | 18 à 21 s | Any tiling texture can go on top, | and the parameters stay editable. |\n| 8 | 21 à 24 s | Here is an extract of the UVs on the geo, | and a second one with the full materials. |\n| 9 | 24 à 27 s | Some details can still be improved, the windows mostly, | where a few UVs stay slightly stretched. |\n| 10 | 27 à 30 s | thanks for watching, follow, | like for more! ᕙ(\\`▿´)ᕗ |\n\nJ'ai redistribué ton contenu sur les cues 8 et 9 pour libérer le dixième, ce qui garde les 30 secondes intactes et ne casse pas le calage des trois plans de caméra.\n\n**Le post, qui retrouve `reading`**\n\nToday I focused on UV texel harmony across the whole church.\n\nThe problem I had was simple: from one pattern to the next, my